---
import Image from "astro/components/Image.astro";
import profile from "../assets/pictures/profile.jpg";
import EducationEntry from "../components/EducationEntry.astro";
import JobEntry from "../components/JobEntry.astro";
import TeachingEntry from "../components/TeachingEntry.astro";
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

const year = new Date().getFullYear();

const navLinks = [
  { href: "/resources", label: "Resources" },
  { href: "/publications", label: "Publications" },
  { href: "/qr", label: "QR" },
  { href: "https://www.youtube.com/@MiguelPuntoEs", label: "YouTube", external: true },
];
---

<Layout
  bare
  title="Miguel González Calvo - Senior LLM Engineer | AI & Data Science"
  description="Miguel González Calvo - Senior LLM Engineer. 8+ years in software development, 5+ in Data Science. Specialized in LLMs, time series, and AI."
>
  <div class="grid min-h-screen md:grid-cols-[minmax(300px,42%)_1fr]">
    <div class="duotone relative h-[46vh] overflow-hidden md:sticky md:top-0 md:h-screen">
      <Image
        src={profile}
        alt="Miguel González Calvo"
        class="h-full w-full object-cover grayscale contrast-[1.08] brightness-[1.02]"
        width={886}
        height={886}
        loading="eager"
        fetchpriority="high"
      />
      <span class="absolute left-[18px] bottom-[14px] z-2 text-[11px] text-white/85"
        >Madrid, 40.42°N 3.70°W</span
      >
    </div>

    <main class="max-w-[760px] px-7 pb-20 pt-12 md:px-[clamp(28px,6vw,84px)]">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-4 text-[13px] font-semibold">
        <span class="text-soft">miguel.es</span>
        <nav aria-label="Main" class="flex flex-wrap gap-[18px]">
          <a href="/" aria-current="page" class="text-accent">Home</a>
          {
            navLinks.map(({ href, label, external }) => (
              <a
                href={href}
                target={external ? "_blank" : undefined}
                rel={external ? "noopener noreferrer" : undefined}
                class="text-ink hover:text-accent"
              >
                {label}
              </a>
            ))
          }
        </nav>
      </div>

      <h1
        class="relative z-3 mt-11 text-[clamp(42px,6.5vw,74px)] font-[850] leading-[0.96] tracking-[-0.04em] md:-ml-[clamp(40px,12vw,160px)]"
      >
        Miguel<span class="block">González Calvo</span>
      </h1>

      <p class="deck mt-[26px] max-w-[32ch] text-[clamp(20px,2.6vw,26px)] leading-[1.35] tracking-[-0.01em]">
        Builds with <b class="font-bold">language models</b> by day; teaches
        <span class="mk">economics, Python and blockchain</span> the rest of the time.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-[18px] text-[13px] text-soft">
        Senior LLM Engineer, A5 Labs · Madrid → California, remotely
      </p>

      <div class="copy mt-[34px] max-w-[58ch]">
        <p class="dropcap mb-[14px]">
          The path wasn't straight: aerospace engineering first, then signal theory, four countries
          of software and data work — weather at AEMet, satellites at Airbus, precision instruments
          at Leica — before settling into data science and, for the last years, LLM engineering.
        </p>
        <p>
          The economics came later, deliberately: an MA at Universidad de las Hespérides, a
          <a href="/publications">thesis on the quantity theory of money</a>, and now courses at
          three universities plus a set of <a href="/resources">calculators on live OECD data</a>
          that students and strangers actually use.
        </p>
      </div>

      <blockquote
        class="my-10 max-w-[30ch] border-l-4 border-accent pl-5 text-[22px] font-bold leading-[1.3] tracking-[-0.015em]"
      >
        "Aero → signals → data → LLMs. The tools change; the engineering doesn't."
        <span class="mt-2 block text-[13px] font-normal text-soft">— the short version of the CV</span>
      </blockquote>

      <section aria-labelledby="h-experience">
        <h2 id="h-experience" class="text-[13px] font-extrabold text-accent">Experience</h2>
        <hr class="mb-[5px] mt-1 border-t-2 border-ink" />
        <div class="divide-y divide-line">
          <JobEntry
            jobTitle="Senior LLM Engineer"
            companyName="A5 Labs"
            dateRange="2025 —"
            location="California (remote)"
          />
          <JobEntry
            jobTitle="Lead Data Scientist"
            companyName="Pascual"
            dateRange="2024 – 25"
            location="Madrid"
          />
          <JobEntry
            jobTitle="Data Scientist"
            companyName="toom Baumarkt"
            dateRange="2023 – 24"
            location="Cologne"
          />
          <JobEntry
            jobTitle="Product Engineer"
            companyName="Leica Geosystems"
            dateRange="2019 – 23"
            location="Heerbrugg"
          />
          <JobEntry
            jobTitle="Software Engineer"
            companyName="Airbus Defence & Space"
            dateRange="2018 – 19"
            location="Munich"
          />
          <JobEntry
            jobTitle="Software Engineer"
            companyName="GMV"
            dateRange="2017"
            location="Tres Cantos"
          />
          <JobEntry
            jobTitle="Developer, intern"
            companyName="AEMet"
            dateRange="2016"
            location="Madrid"
          />
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-[46px]" aria-labelledby="h-teaching">
        <h2 id="h-teaching" class="text-[13px] font-extrabold text-accent">Teaching</h2>
        <hr class="mb-[5px] mt-1 border-t-2 border-ink" />
        <div class="divide-y divide-line">
          <TeachingEntry
            courseName="IA: Tu Copiloto Académico"
            url="/courses/academic-copilot"
            university="U. Francisco Marroquín"
            dateRange="2026"
          />
          <TeachingEntry
            courseName="Python for Finance"
            url="/courses/python-for-finance"
            university="U. Francisco Marroquín"
            dateRange="2025 —"
          />
          <TeachingEntry
            courseName="Technology"
            url="/courses/technology"
            university="U. Francisco Marroquín"
            dateRange="2025 —"
          />
          <TeachingEntry
            courseName="International Economics and Globalization"
            url="/courses/international-economics"
            university="U. de las Hespérides"
            dateRange="2025 —"
          />
          <TeachingEntry
            courseName="Blockchain"
            url="/courses/blockchain"
            university="U. Alfonso X el Sabio"
            dateRange="2025 —"
          />
          <TeachingEntry
            courseName="Economics I"
            url="/courses/economics-i"
            university="U. Francisco Marroquín"
            dateRange="2025"
          />
          <TeachingEntry
            courseName="Python Seminar"
            university="U. Francisco Marroquín"
            dateRange="2025"
          />
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-[46px]" aria-labelledby="h-education">
        <h2 id="h-education" class="text-[13px] font-extrabold text-accent">Education</h2>
        <hr class="mb-[5px] mt-1 border-t-2 border-ink" />
        <div class="divide-y divide-line">
          <EducationEntry
            degree="MA Economics"
            university="U. de las Hespérides"
            dateRange="2023 – 24"
            note="Quantity Theory of Money Around the Globe · honors in six subjects"
          />
          <EducationEntry
            degree="MSc Signal Theory & Communications"
            university="UPM"
            dateRange="2017 – 19"
            note="Coaxial-to-waveguide transitions and mode transducers · 10/10, distinction"
          />
          <EducationEntry
            degree="BSc Aerospace Engineering"
            university="UPM"
            dateRange="2012 – 16"
            note="Air navigation systems · SIGMET/AIRMET decoding tool · 9.5/10"
          />
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-[46px]" aria-labelledby="h-tools">
        <h2 id="h-tools" class="text-[13px] font-extrabold text-accent">Tools</h2>
        <hr class="mb-[14px] mt-1 border-t-2 border-ink" />
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          <a href="/resources/salary-explorer" class="pill">Salary Explorer</a>
          <a href="/resources/inflation-calculator" class="pill">Inflation Calculator</a>
          <a href="/resources/ppp-calculator" class="pill">PPP Calculator</a>
          <a href="/resources/compound-calculator" class="pill">Compound Interest</a>
          <a href="/resources/loan-calculator" class="pill">Loan Amortization</a>
          <a href="/qr" class="pill">QR Generator</a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-[46px]" aria-labelledby="h-contact">
        <h2 id="h-contact" class="text-[13px] font-extrabold text-accent">Contact</h2>
        <hr class="mb-[14px] mt-1 border-t-2 border-ink" />
        <p class="copy max-w-[52ch] text-[14.5px] text-soft">
          Messages through this site aren't monitored — reach me on
          <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/mgcalvo/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="contact-link">LinkedIn</a>
          or
          <a href="https://github.com/MiguelPuntoEs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="contact-link">GitHub</a>.
          Also served over Tor:
        </p>
        <a
          href="http://miguel3wuxsv5wb63n7522pvk7tpwc3lvsvbdzai32bvvca2ac5olbqd.onion/"
          class="mt-2 block break-all font-mono text-[10.5px] text-soft hover:text-accent"
          >miguel3wuxsv5wb63n7522pvk7tpwc3lvsvbdzai32bvvca2ac5olbqd.onion</a
        >
      </section>

      <footer
        class="mt-12 flex flex-wrap justify-between gap-2 border-t-2 border-ink pt-[14px] text-[12.5px] text-soft"
      >
        <span>© {year} Miguel González Calvo</span>
        <span>One photo, one orange, Helvetica.</span>
      </footer>
    </main>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .duotone::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: var(--color-accent);
    mix-blend-mode: multiply;
    opacity: 0.32;
  }
  .deck .mk {
    background-image: linear-gradient(transparent 62%, rgba(217, 95, 2, 0.25) 62%);
    -webkit-box-decoration-break: clone;
    box-decoration-break: clone;
  }
  .dropcap::first-letter {
    float: left;
    font-size: 3.1em;
    font-weight: 850;
    line-height: 0.85;
    padding: 4px 8px 0 0;
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }
  .copy a {
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-color: var(--color-accent);
    text-decoration-thickness: 1.5px;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }
  .copy a:hover {
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }
  .copy .contact-link {
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }
  .pill {
    border: 1.5px solid var(--color-ink);
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 6px 14px;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    font-weight: 650;
  }
  .pill:hover {
    background: var(--color-ink);
    color: var(--color-paper);
  }
</style>
